[{"answer":"Hello, this is Land Transport Information at Toronto Airport.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/1.mp3"},{"answer":"How may I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm flying to Toronto Airport next week, and I need to get to a town called um, Milton.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you tell me how I can get there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Milton, did you say?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that's about 150 miles southwest of here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/8.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, it's 147 miles to be exact,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/9.mp3"},{"answer":"so it'll take you at least - say, three to four hours by road.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Wow! Is it as far as that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I'm afraid so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/12.mp3"},{"answer":"But you have a number of options to get you there","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and you can always rent a car right here at the airport, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I don't really want to drive myself, so...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like more information about public transport.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/17.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/18.mp3"},{"answer":"In that case the quickest and most comfortable is a cab","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and of course there are always plenty available.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/20.mp3"},{"answer":"But it'll cost you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/21.mp3"},{"answer":"You can also take a Greyhound bus or there's an Airport Shuttle Service to Milton.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh, I think for that kind of distance a cab would be way beyond my budget.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/23.mp3"},{"answer":"But the bus sounds OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you tell me how much that would cost?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's see, that would be $15 one way,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/27.mp3"},{"answer":"or 27.50 return...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/28.mp3"},{"answer":"that's on the Greyhound.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's quite cheap - great!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh... but whereabouts does it stop in Milton?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/31.mp3"},{"answer":"It goes directly from the airport here to the City Centre, and it's pretty fast.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/32.mp3"},{"answer":"But you have to bear in mind that there is only one departure a day,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/33.mp3"},{"answer":"so it depends what time your flight gets in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Hang on, we're due to get there at 11.30 am.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmmm, too bad,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/37.mp3"},{"answer":"the bus leaves at 3.45,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/38.mp3"},{"answer":"so you would have quite a wait - more than 4 hours.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, what about the shuttle you mentioned?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/41.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/42.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the Airport Shuttle that will take you from the airport right to your hotel or private address.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/43.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a door-to-door service and it would suit you much better, because there's one every two hours.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/44.mp3"},{"answer":"So how much does that cost?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that's $35 one way, $65 return,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/47.mp3"},{"answer":"so I guess it's a bit more expensive than the Greyhound.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that doesn't sound too bad,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/49.mp3"},{"answer":"especially if it'll take me straight to the hotel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/50.mp3"},{"answer":"But you do need to reserve a seat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/51.mp3"},{"answer":"OK,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/52.mp3"},{"answer":"is it possible to make a booking right now? Through you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/54.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, I just have to fill this form out for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/55.mp3"},{"answer":"So what date do you want to book this for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/56.mp3"},{"answer":"The 16th of October.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, oh, no, sorry, that's my departure date.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/58.mp3"},{"answer":"I arrive on the 17th, so book it for then, please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/59.mp3"},{"answer":"So, that's the Toronto Airport Shuttle to Milton.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/60.mp3"},{"answer":"And this is for just one person or...?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, just me, please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/63.mp3"},{"answer":"And you said your expected time of arrival was 11.30?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/64.mp3"},{"answer":"So if I book your Shuttle for after 12.00 - let's say 12.30,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/65.mp3"},{"answer":"that should give you plenty of time to, you know, collect your baggage, maybe grab a coffee?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that sounds fine, as long as we land on time!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we'll take your flight details so you don't need to worry too much about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, what about the fare?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/69.mp3"},{"answer":"What sort of ticket do you want?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/70.mp3"},{"answer":"One way or...?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that'll be fine, provided I can book the return trip once I'm there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/72.mp3"},{"answer":"No problem - just allow a couple of days in advance to make sure you get a seat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/73.mp3"},{"answer":"And what is your name, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Janet, Janet Thomson.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that Thompson spelt with a 'p'?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/76.mp3"},{"answer":"No, it's THOMSON.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/77.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/78.mp3"},{"answer":"And you'll be coming from the UK?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/79.mp3"},{"answer":"What flight will you be traveling on?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, it's Air Canada flight number AC936, from London Heathrow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, do you know where you'll be staying?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/83.mp3"},{"answer":"We need to give the driver an address.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's called the Vacation Motel","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/85.mp3"},{"answer":"and I think it's near the town centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, the address is 24, Kitchener Street -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/87.mp3"},{"answer":"that's KITCHENER Street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/88.mp3"},{"answer":"That's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/89.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, so that's $35 to pay, please. Have you got your credit card number there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/90.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's a VISA card,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/91.mp3"},{"answer":"and the number is 3303 8450 2045 6837.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/92.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. Well, that seems to be everything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/93.mp3"},{"answer":"Have a good trip and we'll see you in Toronto next week!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/94.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, bye. Oh, thanks for your help!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-1-part-1-2023-07-28-10-53-48/95.mp3"}]
